{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13533","headline":"杂诗 · 张彪","name":"杂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富贵多胜事，贪贱无良图。\n上德兼济心，中才不如愚。\n商者多巧智，农者争膏腴。\n儒生未遇时，衣食不自如。\n久与故交别，他荣我穷居。\n到门懒入门，何况千里余。\n君子有褊性，矧乃寻常徒。\n行行任天地，无爲强亲疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}